              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% set t = states('sensor.opentherm_flow_temperature') | float(0) %}\n{% set f = ((t - 25) / 35) | min(1) | max(0) if t > 0 else 0 %}\n{% set r = [510 * f, 255] | min | int %}\n{% set g = [510 * (1 - f), 255] | min | int %}\n{% set n = (f * 10) | round | int %}\n<font color=\"{{ '#%02x%02x%02x' | format(r, g, 60) }}\">**Flow {{ 'off' if t == 0 else (t | round(1) ~ ' \u00b0C') }}** {{ '\u25ae' * n }}{{ '\u25af' * (10 - n) }}</font>"
